@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Astral Project — Projected-HOME Learning and Approval
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Agent harness\n(untrusted)" as A
participant "Optional observer\n(diagnostic only)" as O
participant "aspr-homed\n(enforcement point)" as F
participant "asprd\napproval broker" as D
participant "Trusted terminal\ncontroller" as U
database "Host HOME /\nprofile backing" as H

A -> O : attempt path operation
O --> D : diagnostic intended full path
note right of O
Failure or absence of the observer
never enlarges access.
end note

A -> F : lookup/read/write/readdir
F -> F : match path, scope, mode,\nand operation class

alt Existing rule authorizes operation
  F -> H : safely open approved backing object
  H --> F : handle/data
  F --> A : continue operation
else Existing rule denies operation
  F --> A : EACCES or ENOENT; audit
else Unknown component or operation
  F -> D : pending request
  D -> U : display trusted prompt + provenance
  U -> D : deny/hide, allow once, persist,\nor opaque traversal + exact leaf
  D -> F : session rule and optional profile draft
  alt Approved within finite timeout
    F -> H : safely open approved backing object
    H --> F : handle/data
    F --> A : continue operation
  else Denied or timed out
    F --> A : fail closed
  end
end

note over A,U
The agent cannot access the administrative approval channel
and cannot approve its own request.
end note
@enduml
